  "description": "God gave me a chance to relive my life. Before the rebirth, I had been used for the past 400 years as the empire's sword. And so, I swore to destroy the empire. I found the young prince of the country and became his teacher. I taught him how to become a tyrant and asked for the country. \n\n\"I will do the lady's will.\"\n\nHe conquered the whole empire for me, and I ran away.\n\n\"I came to take you, Charlize Ronan.\" Dylan became a perfect tyrant and searched the entire empire for me.\n\n\"You tamed me, so why did you run away?\"",
